<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P puts Burns Philp on negative watch.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P puts Burns Philp on negative watch.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ratings agency Standard &amp; Poor's said on Tuesday it had put food group Burns Philp &amp; Co Ltd's BBB plus/A-2 credit ratings on negative creditwatch after the group announced plans to sell its U.S. and European spice units.</p>
</text>
